grok-companion

Structure and command surface follow the author's gemini-companion plugin
(MIT), https://github.com/Gfriend997/gemini-companion, and kimi-companion
(MIT), https://github.com/Gfriend997/kimi-companion, which in turn were
inspired by the OpenAI Codex plugin for Claude Code,
https://github.com/openai/codex-plugin-cc (Apache License 2.0, Copyright
OpenAI). No third-party source was copied; the runtime was written fresh
against the xAI (Grok) REST API.

Not affiliated with or endorsed by OpenAI or xAI.
